  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "のうりょくを　ひきだす　どくそでできた　くさりに　のうを　しげきされサイコパワーが　かいかした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "능력을 끌어올리는 독소로 된 사슬에 뇌가 자극을 받아 사이코 파워가 개화했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由能夠激發潛力的毒素所構成的鎖鏈刺激了牠的腦部，使牠的精神力量開竅了。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les toxines de sa chaîne sont capables de révéler un potentiel latent. En stimulant son cerveau, elles lui ont conféré des pouvoirs psychiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Potenzial entfaltenden Giftstoffe in der Kette haben sein Gehirn stimuliert und seine Psycho-Kräfte aufblühen lassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las toxinas de la cadena, capaces de sacar a relucir su potencial, le han estimulado el cerebro y le han hecho desarrollar poderes psíquicos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua catena, composta di tossine che accrescono le sue capacità, gli ha stimolato il cervello, donandogli poteri psichici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The chain is made from toxins that enhance capabilities. It stimulated Munkidori’s brain and caused the Pokémon’s psychic powers to bloom.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能力を　引き出す　毒素でできた　鎖に　脳を　刺激されサイコパワーが　開花した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由能激发潜能的毒素构成的锁链刺激了脑部，开发出了精神力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las toxinas de la cadena, capaces de sacar a relucir su potencial, le han estimulado el cerebro y le han hecho desarrollar poderes psíquicos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あんぜんな　ばしょから　きょうれつなめまいを　ひきおこす　ねんりきをはなって　てきを　ほんろうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "안전한 장소에서 강한 현기증을 일으키는 염력을 사용해 적을 농락한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從安全的地方釋放出能引起強烈頭暈的念力，把敵手戲弄得團團轉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se met en lieu sûr et il joue avec ses adversaires en provoquant chez eux de terribles vertiges grâce à ses pouvoirs psychiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es spielt mit seinen Feinden, indem es von einem sicheren Ort aus telekinetische Energie ausstrahlt, die starken Schwindel verursacht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Utiliza sus poderes psíquicos desde un lugar seguro para provocar fuertes mareos a sus enemigos y divertirse a su costa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mette nel sacco i nemici emettendo da un luogo sicuro una forza psichica che causa fortissime vertigini.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Munkidori keeps itself somewhere safe while it toys with its foes, using psychokinesis to induce intense dizziness.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "安全な　場所から　強烈なめまいを　引き起こす　念力を放って　敵を　翻弄する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会从安全的地方释放出能引起强烈头晕的念力，将敌人玩弄于股掌之间。",
      "language": {
